 * maps the vector onto the flight channel — this component has no
 * knowledge of the game whatsoever.
 *
 * Pointer events + setPointerCapture: once a finger lands on the base,
 * drags outside the element keep tracking too (the capture is on the base
 * div). The knob follows, clamped to the radius. If the magnitude is
 * within `deadzone` (a fraction of the radius), {0, 0} is emitted. On
 * release/cancel, {0, 0} is emitted once and the knob snaps back to
 * center.
 *
 * Accessibility: role="slider" + aria-label gives the a11y suite (TASK-54)
